{"unit_id":"gggtmd__dsh-wallet-hud#card-zh","repo":"gggtmd/dsh-wallet-hud","commit":"b1050da030dbfc29e337167303d92de6af1a4800","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Wallet HUD（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DeepSeek Harness Web UI 侧边栏底部显示已登录账号的钱包余额。它通过 sidebar.footer.action 槽位注册可点击的余额胶囊，并从宿主已有的 account.getBalance Remote 读取数据。主要功能包括显示充值余额与赠送余额、悬浮查看金额和更新时间、点击刷新，以及区分加载、未登录和失败状态；页面聚焦或可见时定期更新。适合希望在侧栏快速查看 DeepSeek 账户余额的用户。使用前需要运行提供账户服务的 Harness 组合，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:399-423","client.js:288-396"]}
{"unit_id":"gggtmd__dsh-wallet-hud#card-en","repo":"gggtmd/dsh-wallet-hud","commit":"b1050da030dbfc29e337167303d92de6af1a4800","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Wallet HUD is a DSH Web plugin for viewing a signed-in DeepSeek wallet balance in the sidebar. The chip shows recharge and bonus amounts, update time, and loading, signed-out or failure states. Click to refresh; it updates periodically too. Uses the host account service and needs no extra key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:399-423","client.js:288-396"]}
