{"unit_id":"gggtmd__dsh-wallet-hud#feature-feature-1","repo":"gggtmd/dsh-wallet-hud","commit":"b1050da030dbfc29e337167303d92de6af1a4800","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Wallet HUD 的功能「侧栏余额」：在 Harness Web 侧栏底部显示当前账户余额。页面首次挂载后读取宿主账户服务；宽侧栏显示余额标签，折叠时保留居中窄版金额。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:288-396","client.js:411-420"]}
